		"bda6b5b5bfecc3bcc0ccbcad:b7ceb1d7 bdb4b6f3:b8f9c5a9 bdb4c6dbb3ebbaf1bdba:c3cabab8c0da " +
		"bdbab3aac0ccc6db:c7e5c5cd bdbac5e4c4bf:b7ceb1d7 bec6c5a9baf1bcf3:c7c1b8aebdbac6ae " +
		"beeebdd8bdc5c5a9b7cebdba:beeebcbcbdc5c5a9b7cebdba bfa9b8a7:b0e1c8a5 bfa9b8a732:b0e1c8a5 " +
		"bfc1c5e4b9f6c6d0bdbac6ae:b0e1c8a5 bff8b4f5b7af:b9abc8f1 c1a6b3d7b8af:bfacb1ddbcfabbe7 c1fdbdc3:b9abc8f1 " +
		"c3a8c7c7bfc2:b8f9c5a9 c5a9b8aebfa1c0ccc5cd:bfacb1ddbcfabbe7 c5acb6f3bfee:b9d9b5e5 " +
		"c6c8b6f3b5f2:c5a9b7e7bcbcc0ccb4f5 c6e4c4dab0cbbbe7:c6e4c4dac6e4c4da5fb1e2bbe7 " +
		"c6e4c4dac6c8b6f3b5f2:bdc5c6e4c4dac5a9b7e7bcbcc0ccb4f5 c7c1b7cec6e4bcad:bcbcc0ccc1f6 " +
		"c7cfc0ccc7c1b8ae:c7c1b8aebdbac6ae c7d1bab9:b0e1c8a5 c7d8c5c2bcbac1a6:c5c2b1c7bcd2b3e2 " +
		"c7d8c5c2bcd2bfefb8aec6db:c5c2b1c7bcd2b3e2 c8adc0ccc6aebdbab9ccbdba:c1a6c3b6b0f8 ";
	const luaStr = function(hex)
	{
		let s = "";
		for (let i = 0; i < hex.length; i += 2)
		{
			const c = parseInt(hex.substr(i, 2), 16);
			s += (c >= 0x20 && c < 0x7F && c !== 0x22 && c !== 0x5C) ? String.fromCharCode(c) : "\\" + c;
		}
		return "\"" + s + "\"";
	};
	let stockLua = "";
	for (const pair of stockBodyPaths.trim().split(" "))
	{
		const [id, hex] = pair.split(":");
		stockLua += "[" + id + "]=" + luaStr(hex) + ",";
	}
	let imfLua = "";
	for (const pair of stockImfNames.trim().split(" "))
	{
		const [body, imf] = pair.split(":");
		imfLua += "[" + luaStr(body) + "]=" + luaStr(imf) + ",";
	}
	// Phase 15's garment answer. Once Phase 15 renames the question, the client asks PCNewDrawOnTop (not Gravity's
	// _New_DrawOnTop) for every garment it draws, so it is defined first, before anything in this chunk can fail at
	// run time. cjrx holds PCRobeInheritTbl (any job); cjrd holds the stock job each custom job layers like, used
	// only while Gravity's own table has no row for that job. Any other job is asked exactly as before.
	const robeLua = ' local cjrx,cjrd={},{} function PCNewDrawOnTop(r,s,j,...) local m=cjrx[j] if m==nil then m=cjrd[j]'
		+ ' if m~=nil then local t=_New_GetLayerDirTbl(s,r) if t~=nil and t[GetSpriteInherite2Job(j)]~=nil then m=nil end end end'
		+ ' return _New_DrawOnTop(r,s,m or j,...) end';
	luaCode = 'local cjim={' + imfLua + '} local cjst={' + stockLua + '}' + robeLua
		+ ' if type(PCPaths)~="table" then PCPaths={} end setmetatable(PCPaths,{__index=cjst}) ' + luaCode;
	// The client finds sprite folders by their Korean CP949 bytes; written as their Latin-1 look-alike
	// ("°Ë»ç" for 검사) in a UTF-8 file, each byte arrives as a two-byte pair. Fold those pairs back in
	// the four path tables, but only for a value made entirely of such pairs plus ASCII: real CP949 bytes
	// and any other UTF-8 text are left alone. At least two pairs: four real Korean syllables (창 책 철 청)
	// are each exactly one such pair in CP949, and the shortest look-alike name (one syllable) is two.
	// Every client Lua state opens the string library
	// (CLuaState__Constructor 0x005190f0 calls luaL_openlibs 0x00525360).
	luaCode += ' local function cjfx(s) if type(s)~="string" then return s end local u="[\\194\\195][\\128-\\191]" local r,n=string.gsub(s,u,function(c) local a,b=string.byte(c,1,2) return string.char((a-192)*64+b-128) end) if n>1 and not string.find(string.gsub(s,u,""),"[\\128-\\255]") then return r end return s end'
		+ ' for _,t in pairs({PCPaths,PCImfs,PCPals,PCHands}) do if type(t)=="table" then for k,v in pairs(t) do if type(v)=="table" then for k2,v2 in pairs(v) do v[k2]=cjfx(v2) end else t[k]=cjfx(v) end end end end';
	// The head position (IMF) table gets each PCPaths value, except a stock body whose IMF name differs gets that
	// name (Phase 11's third populate call reads _CJ_IMF). After the fold, so a look-alike name maps too.
	luaCode += ' _CJ_IMF={} if type(PCPaths)=="table" then for k,v in pairs(PCPaths) do if type(k)=="number" then'
		+ ' _CJ_IMF[k]=(type(v)=="string" and cjim[v]) or v end end end';
	// Phase 15's tables, after the fold so a look-alike folder name matches its stock body. A PCRobeInheritTbl row
	// wins for any job. Otherwise each custom job (a PCPaths row) layers like its PCMotionInheritTbl job, else the
	// stock job whose body folder it names (the lowest id with that folder), else Novice.
	luaCode += ' if type(PCRobeInheritTbl)=="table" then for k,v in pairs(PCRobeInheritTbl) do'
		+ ' if type(k)=="number" and type(v)=="number" then cjrx[k]=v end end end'
		+ ' local cjfo={} for k,v in pairs(cjst) do if cjfo[v]==nil or k<cjfo[v] then cjfo[v]=k end end'
		+ ' local cjmo=type(PCMotionInheritTbl)=="table" and PCMotionInheritTbl or {}'
		+ ' if type(PCPaths)=="table" then for k,v in pairs(PCPaths) do if type(k)=="number" then local m=cjmo[k]'
		+ ' if type(m)~="number" then m=cjfo[v] or 0 end cjrd[k]=m end end end';

	if (failMode === 1) {
		// Log File: write errors to customjobs_error.log
		luaCode += ' if #errs>0 then local msg=errs[1] for i=2,#errs do msg=msg.."\\n"..errs[i] end local f=io.open("customjobs_error.log","w") if f then f:write(msg) f:close() end end';
	} else if (failMode === 2) {
